.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619059_2002252923793577_3204368682674529714_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4neXdwSLcQsQ7kNvwFwYurj&_nc_oc=AdrOg0aNbM-D3qJL42Q8A4dw2CxvhUwOgFt_lG2fuaCceaiHvzRDuQC-VDOWX6F-wpc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO0OEvVb9NSJIaBDYY6LTtwHnrYRZVi_Nst1qkcjBHaUQ&oe=6ADE017F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "star_cover.png", "id": "28725425130416810", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623512_28725425140416809_5513349611134248212_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LJeN12s1rpoQ7kNvwE7ETsT&_nc_oc=Adqho99lAb634lBFAvgjo5lyQhkWTGTV3YE-mIFLR5QesgMKdVeLwJJwyZ4C7d8hl_g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM83sA5jh9jdfRwYnxevF9fpvXhiu06doLBGnRN_TL4zA&oe=6ADE0480"}, "display_name": "Zen Stargazer", "keywords": ["astronomy", "stargazing", "stars", "planets", "constellations"], "long_description": "Zen Stargazer is mixed-reality stargazing for Meta Quest. Keep your room real while the sky follows your time and place\u2014or switch into virtual vistas and keep watching the stars.\n\nPOINT TO LEARN\nAim the right controller to identify stars, planets, nebulae, and galaxies, with short notes for bright landmarks.\n\nTIME & PLACE\nFollow live \u201cnow,\u201d or lock an observing time. Pick a city on the world map and the sky updates instantly\u2014great for a meteor peak or an eclipse night.\n\nCONSTELLATIONS & DEEP SKY\nToggle constellation lines, the ecliptic, and selected deep-sky objects. Some include public-domain astronomy imagery.\n\nPLANETS & MOON\nExplore phases, moon light, Galilean moons, and Saturn\u2019s ring tilt in a telescope-style view. Jump chips hop to related events.\n\nMETEOR SHOWERS & EVENT BOOK\nBrowse classic showers and key sky events, with notes on what to expect and why most showers come from parent-body dust.\n\nPASSTHROUGH, SCENES & FULL SKY\nLeft stick up/down sets reveal height; push further for a full-sphere / space view. Left/right cycles scenes: passthrough, or virtual vistas (mountain lake, living room, desert, snowy ryokan, sky bar). At the sky bar, stars overlay without cutting the scene away. Export a 360\u00b0 sky still.\n\nLANGUAGES\nTraditional Chinese, English, and Japanese\u2014switch anytime from the info pad.\n\nUse a clear guardian boundary. Keep Quest OS updated if launch stalls on very old builds. Educational approximations\u2014not a substitute for professional almanacs.", "short_description": "Look up in mixed reality on Meta Quest. Point to learn stars and planets; scrub time and place; follow showers and eclipses. Left stick sets reveal height and cycles scenes\u2014passthrough or virtual vistas (lake, living room, desert, ryokan, sky bar). \u7e41\u4e2d / English / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e."}]}, "developer_name": "Zen Chang", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.zenchang.com/2026/09/privacy-policy-zen-stargazer.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Zen Chang", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.zenchang.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_TW", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1911551750252715"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499627379_1135603582374314_981033053078344399_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_n